# Production URL of the site (no trailing slash). Used for canonical URLs,
# Open Graph, and structured data. Leave unset until the domain is decided.
NEXT_PUBLIC_SITE_URL=

# Optional overrides for the contact form (see src/data/contact.ts).
# NEXT_PUBLIC_CONTACT_PROVIDER=formspree   # none | formspree | netlify | endpoint | mailto
# NEXT_PUBLIC_CONTACT_ENDPOINT=https://formspree.io/f/xxxxxxx
